// Her climbing is the standard's: she takes a wall she walks or falls into, climbs it at 2.2 m/s on ten seconds of
// stamina, leaps 1.8 m along it for a fifth of the wheel, and pulls up over a top her hands can reach, 2.3 m above her
// feet. Jump leaps, run lets go.
import "../../standard/abilities"
climbAbility(kit: "walker")
